                                        <span class="sl-mono">CNC-2026-0042</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="lp-pv-title">Concours de recrutement — Analystes crédit</div>
                                    <div class="lp-pv-meta">Clôturé le 14/10/2026 à 11:30 · 248 candidats · seuil 60&#160;%</div>
                                    <table class="lp-pv-table">
                                        <thead><tr><th>Rang</th><th>N° d’inscription</th><th class="r">Note</th><th>Décision</th></tr></thead>
                                        <tbody>
                                            <tr><td>1</td><td class="sl-mono">RC-0117</td><td class="r">92,5&#160;%</td><td><span class="lp-pv-ok">Admis</span></td></tr>
                                            <tr><td>2</td><td class="sl-mono">RC-0042</td><td class="r">88,0&#160;%</td><td><span class="lp-pv-ok">Admis</span></td></tr>
                                            <tr><td>3</td><td class="sl-mono">RC-0203</td><td class="r">81,5&#160;%</td><td><span class="lp-pv-ok">Admis</span></td></tr>
                                            <tr><td>4</td><td class="sl-mono">RC-0009</td><td class="r">74,0&#160;%</td><td><span class="lp-pv-ok">Admis</span></td></tr>
                                            <tr class="lp-pv-fade"><td>5</td><td class="sl-mono">RC-0158</td><td class="r">57,5&#160;%</td><td><span class="lp-pv-no">Non admis</span></td></tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                    <div class="lp-pv-foot">
                                        <svg class="lp-pv-qr" viewBox="-1 -1 23 23" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h7v1h-7zM8 0h5v1h-5zM14 0h7v1h-7zM0 1h1v1h-1zM6 1h1v1h-1zM10 1h1v1h-1zM12 1h1v1h-1zM14 1h1v1h-1zM20 1h1v1h-1zM0 2h1v1h-1zM2 2h3v1h-3zM6 2h1v1h-1zM9 2h2v1h-2zM12 2h1v1h-1zM14 2h1v1h-1zM16 2h3v1h-3zM20 2h1v1h-1zM0 3h1v1h-1zM2 3h3v1h-3zM6 3h1v1h-1zM12 3h1v1h-1zM14 3h1v1h-1zM16 3h3v1h-3zM20 3h1v1h-1zM0 4h1v1h-1zM2 4h3v1h-3zM6 4h1v1h-1zM10 4h3v1h-3zM14 4h1v1h-1zM16 4h3v1h-3zM20 4h1v1h-1zM0 5h1v1h-1zM6 5h1v1h-1zM10 5h1v1h-1zM14 5h1v1h-1zM20 5h1v1h-1zM0 6h7v1h-7zM8 6h1v1h-1zM11 6h2v1h-2zM14 6h7v1h-7zM8 7h1v1h-1zM10 7h1v1h-1zM0 8h2v1h-2zM8 8h1v1h-1zM10 8h5v1h-5zM17 8h1v1h-1zM0 9h5v1h-5zM8 9h1v1h-1zM11 9h1v1h-1zM16 9h2v1h-2zM19 9h1v1h-1zM1 10h2v1h-2zM5 10h3v1h-3zM10 10h1v1h-1zM14 10h1v1h-1zM16 10h2v1h-2zM1 11h1v1h-1zM4 11h4v1h-4zM9 11h3v1h-3zM13 11h2v1h-2zM17 11h1v1h-1zM1 12h4v1h-4zM6 12h2v1h-2zM10 12h1v1h-1zM14 12h1v1h-1zM16 12h2v1h-2zM9 13h1v1h-1zM14 13h1v1h-1zM18 13h3v1h-3zM0 14h7v1h-7zM9 14h1v1h-1zM12 14h1v1h-1zM14 14h2v1h-2zM18 14h2v1h-2zM0 15h1v1h-1zM6 15h1v1h-1zM8 15h1v1h-1zM11 15h1v1h-1zM15 15h3v1h-3zM19 15h2v1h-2zM0 16h1v1h-1zM2 16h3v1h-3zM6 16h1v1h-1zM8 16h2v1h-2zM11 16h2v1h-2zM16 16h1v1h-1zM18 16h1v1h-1zM20 16h1v1h-1zM0 17h1v1h-1zM2 17h3v1h-3zM6 17h1v1h-1zM8 17h5v1h-5zM14 17h1v1h-1zM16 17h5v1h-5zM0 18h1v1h-1zM2 18h3v1h-3zM6 18h1v1h-1zM8 18h1v1h-1zM10 18h1v1h-1zM14 18h1v1h-1zM18 18h3v1h-3zM0 19h1v1h-1zM6 19h1v1h-1zM9 19h7v1h-7zM19 19h1v1h-1zM0 20h7v1h-7zM8 20h8v1h-8z"/></svg>
                                        <div class="lp-pv-hash">
                                            <div class="lp-pv-hash-label">Empreinte SHA-256</div>
                                            <div class="sl-mono">9f3c 41a8 0be2 77d4 … c05e e71a</div>
