                    <div class="lp-container lp-foot-in">
                        <div class="lp-foot-brand">
                            <div class="lp-mark lp-mark-inv">
                                <span class="lp-mark-seal" aria-hidden="true">S</span>
                                <span class="lp-mark-word">SELECTA</span>
                            </div>
                            <p>La culture de l’excellence. Une solution <t t-out="issuer"/>.</p>
                        </div>
